{"parse": {"title": "LF-06", "pageid": 97031, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LF-05\" title=\"LF-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LF-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/LF-07\" title=\"LF-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BB.8A.E6.97.A5.E5.A4.9A.E7.BE.8E.E5.A5.BD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"今日多美好\">今日多美好</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 今日多美好</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Beautiful Day</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>当<span class=\"color-value\"></span>光<span class=\"color-value\"></span>线<span class=\"color-value\"></span>照<span class=\"color-value\"></span>射<span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>些<span class=\"color-value\"></span>颗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>粒<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>卤<span class=\"color-value\"></span>化<span class=\"color-value\"></span>银<span class=\"color-value\"></span>会<span class=\"color-value\"></span>发<span class=\"color-value\"></span>生<span class=\"color-value\"></span>结<span class=\"color-value\"></span>构<span class=\"color-value\"></span>性<span class=\"color-value\"></span>变<span class=\"color-value\"></span>化<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>形<span class=\"color-value\"></span>成<span class=\"color-value\"></span>银<span class=\"color-value\"></span>粒<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192206</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接下来的日子里，琼斯变得开朗了许多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她会请贝蒂为她读报，拍些公园的景色，或者请求贝蒂转一下玻璃仪器，好让她晒晒太阳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>冬天的时候，我们会把雪分成好几份，然后挑几份，把白糖撒进雪里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有时，二人也会像这样聊聊天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>运气好的话能吃到几份甜的雪，运气不好的话，说不定会吃到煤渣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>你小时候居然也会玩这样的游戏吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>傻丫头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琼斯虚弱地笑了一声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>在成名之前，我也只是一个小村姑罢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不知为何，贝蒂感到了一丝异样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂摇摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我小时候经常偷溜进电影院，电影院人多，也会暖和一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我很喜欢看电影，它能让我暂时忘掉现实里那些不好的事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>所以我很景仰从事电影行业的人，我觉得……他们是在拯救我麻木的心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>这也是我渴望拍电影的原因，因为我也想成为这样的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琼斯看着贝蒂，眼神透露着些许无奈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>我们来拍电影吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>现在？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>我们不是有摄影机吗？一直放着也没有用过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>拍什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琼斯轻轻地笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>你啊。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>跟随贝蒂，中景，上半身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听见琼斯的指令后，虫形底座便驮着摄影机走到了贝蒂的身边，将摄像头对准了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>根据琼斯的请求，贝蒂为她定制了一个可以听懂指令的底座。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这样即使琼斯身在玻璃仪器中，她仍然能够用语言拍到自己想要的景象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我有什么好拍的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂有些害羞地看着仰头盯着自己的摄影机，和之前做替身时不同，当意识到镜头在拍摄真正的她时，她的大脑似乎就停止了运作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>总比拍我要好些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琼斯耸耸肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>好了，别一直站在那里盯着它，你得做你自己的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我自己的事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>比如，为我读读今天的报纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂点了点头，拿出报纸，在琼斯身旁坐下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>起先，她读得磕磕巴巴，但当她的注意力全部都转移到了文字上时，她的行为也变得自然了很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>对，好演员应该是忘记镜头的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>镜头？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂突然想起了什么似的四下张望，在看到摄像机后刷得又红了脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>没事，我们还有很长时间来适应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>往后的日子里，只要走进琼斯的病房，贝蒂就会被摄像机一直盯着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而根据琼斯的请求，每晚，贝蒂都会剪一些片段。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_anfang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_anfang\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_anfang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_6_bg_anfang.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_anfang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_6_bg_anfang.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_anfang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_6_bg_anfang.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_anfang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咔嚓”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>暗红色的房间内，随着剪刀的闭合，一节胶片被贝蒂剪了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>然后是……这一格……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂用铅笔在胶片的背面画上一道线，然后用剪刀沿着线将胶片分割开来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂将胶片放到一边，在纸上画着大大的标题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\">- 苹果核 -</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是因为贝蒂为琼斯的苹果削了皮，而琼斯毫不留情地取笑了贝蒂的刀工。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\">- 法老之夜 -</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这段是琼斯要求贝蒂为自己拍的一段恐怖风格的短片，在镜头中，琼斯满脸绷带，从床上直挺挺地坐了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她怒吼着转过头来，鼻子下面却粘着贝蒂的假胡子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>胶片的最后，是贝蒂笑到颤抖的画面，光影都猛烈地抖动着，就像墨水滴进玻璃杯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>这就是电影……能够永远留下足够美好之物的神奇容器……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂小心翼翼地用夹子将胶片夹起，然后将它们分门别类的放好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>不久以后，琼斯肯定就能够痊愈出院了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>到时候，我再想办法让她接受“暴雨”这件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂看向床头桌上放着的剧本，它已经被默写完成，由于贝蒂一直以双腿做桌，它已经产生了微微的曲度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>然后我们再拍完这部电影。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深夜，病房黑暗，只有仪器的灯光频频闪着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-504701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-504701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-504701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">劳拉：</div><div>你想好了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>驮着摄像机的虫形底座因为没有得到指令而颓坐在地，一动不动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>我不需要钱，我只需要你给我一个东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-504701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-504701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-504701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">劳拉：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琼斯张嘴，吐出了一个不那么美好的词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-504701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-504701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-504701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">劳拉：</div><div>哈哈！这里有更好的替代品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-565501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>随你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>关门声响过之后，病房又恢复了安静。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LF-06"}}